{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04014","headline":"奉和圣制行次成皐途经先圣擒建德之所感而成诗应制 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制行次成皐途经先圣擒建德之所感而成诗应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉东不执象，河朔方鬬龙。\n夏灭渐宁乱，唐兴终奋庸。\n皇威正赫赫，兵气何匈匈。\n用武三川震，归淳六代醲。\n成臯覩王业，天下致人雍。\n即此巡於岱，曾孙受命封。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}